  "source_markdown": {
    "2e-Pi2-01": "\n- **Type**: `2e-Pi2`\n- **Category**: `loop`\n- **Edge counts**: `[0, 0, 1, 1]`\n- **Eikonal count**: 2\n- **Diagrams**: 1\n- **Mirror**: self-mirror\n- **2PI**: True\n\n$$\nI_{(2e-Pi2-01)} = -\\int_0^1 ds_{3,1} \\int_0^1 ds_{4,1}\\;(ig\\,v_{3}^{\\mu_{1}} t^{a_{1}}) (ig\\,v_{4}^{\\mu_{2}} t^{a_{2}})\n\\times \\int \\frac{d^D\\ell}{(2\\pi)^D}\\,\\frac{-ig_{\\mu_{1}\\nu_1}}{\\ell^2+i0}\\,\\Pi^{(2)}_{b_1 b_2}^{\\nu_1\\nu_2}(\\ell)\\,\\frac{-ig_{\\nu_2\\mu_{2}}}{\\ell^2+i0}\\,e^{-i\\ell\\cdot\\bigl(-\\bigl[(1-s_{3,1})\\,v_{3} + s_{4,1}\\,v_{4}\\bigr]\\bigr)}\n\\quad\\text{(SE: ghost+quark+gluon-bubble+4g-tadpole)}\n$$\n",
    "2e-Pi2-02": "\n- **Type**: `2e-Pi2`\n- **Category**: `loop`\n- **Edge counts**: `[0, 1, 0, 1]`\n- **Eikonal count**: 2\n- **Diagrams**: 1\n- **Mirror**: self-mirror\n- **2PI**: True\n\n$$\nI_{(2e-Pi2-02)} = -\\int_0^1 ds_{2,1} \\int_0^1 ds_{4,1}\\;(ig\\,v_{2}^{\\mu_{1}} t^{a_{1}}) (ig\\,v_{4}^{\\mu_{2}} t^{a_{2}})\n\\times \\int \\frac{d^D\\ell}{(2\\pi)^D}\\,\\frac{-ig_{\\mu_{1}\\nu_1}}{\\ell^2+i0}\\,\\Pi^{(2)}_{b_1 b_2}^{\\nu_1\\nu_2}(\\ell)\\,\\frac{-ig_{\\nu_2\\mu_{2}}}{\\ell^2+i0}\\,e^{-i\\ell\\cdot\\bigl((1-s_{4,1})\\,v_{4} + v_{1} + s_{2,1}\\,v_{2}\\bigr)}\n\\quad\\text{(SE: ghost+quark+gluon-bubble+4g-tadpole)}\n$$\n"
  },
